#|
Main wheel + thumb wheel drive pointer Y/X. Normal pointer movement also works.
120 wheel units = one notch, so 0.25 produces 30 pointer units per notch.
Empty v/h output rows suppress scrolling while the wheels move the pointer.

To keep scrolling as well, remove the empty (v) and (h) rows.
To use ONLY the wheels for pointer movement, remove (x 1) and (y 1).
See docs/config.adoc, mouse-axis-map.
|#

(defcfg
  process-unmapped-keys no
  mouse-axis-map (
    (x (x 1) (h 0.25))
    (y (y 1) (v -0.25))
    (v)
    (h)
  )
)
(defsrc)
(deflayer base)
